  "rationale": "The recording (Swagit id 270975, Aug 22, 2023, titled '2024 Capital Bond Streets & Transportation Subcommittee Meeting') is proven to belong to the Streets and Transportation Subcommittee of Dallas' 2024 Capital Bond program: the dallas-streets-archive page from the Office of Bond & Construction Management lists 'Tuesday, August 22, 2023 Streets and Transportation Meeting #6 Video' on that subcommittee's page, and the provider-player confirms the matching title, date, and recording id. The transcript corroborates subcommittee context (Public Works/Transportation staff presenting bond project allocations by council district). Feed assignments follow demonstrated subscription scope: the dedicated 2024 subcommittee feed already carries this exact title pattern (Aug 15 and Oct 27, 2023 examples); the bond-program-meetings feed also carries the same series per its examples; and the transportation-and-infrastructure feed demonstrably includes a '2024 Capital Bond Streets and Transportation Subcommittee Meeting' title (Oct 27, 2023 example). The community-bond-task-force feed is excluded because the convened body here is the subcommittee, not the Task Force: the transcript explicitly distinguishes 'THIS IS THE STREETS COMMITTEE' from 'the overall committee called the Bond Task Force' meeting in the Council Chamber, and no supplied evidence shows the Task Force convening this recording. Ownership is established, so unresolved is not required."
